@startuml
start
:Technician requests a part;
:Check available stock;
if (Enough stock?) then (yes)
  :Reserve and approve non-critical request;
else (no)
  :Open AOG when aircraft is grounded;
  :Create reorder proposal;
  :Planner reviews proposal;
  :Store keeper receives and issues item;
endif
:Technician fits part;
:Close AOG and record duration;
stop
@enduml
